<title>USA: Fox gets nearly 22 mln orders for Independence Day.</title>
<headline>Fox gets nearly 22 mln orders for Independence Day.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twentieth Century Fox Wednesday said it has received nearly 22 million orders from video retailers for its summer blockbuster &quot;Independence Day&quot;</p>
<p>The News Corp unit said the video will be available November 22 at more than 100,000 retailers across the country for a suggested price of $22.98.</p>
<p>The summer adventure film, which depicts an alien invasion of the planet, has already grossed more than $300 million at the box office.</p>
